        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Exit Device Rim Cylinder with Pull Trim</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Pull Trim with Rim Lock Cylinder (turn key to retract latch, release/remove key to engage latch) for use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>. Old Item# PDQ-429PUK \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, pull trim, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-P-03 Pull Trim with Rim Cylinder \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Night Latch - Turn key to retract door latch on exit device, release/remove key to re-engage.</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Includes Trim Ring</li>\r\n<li>Rim Cylinder 5-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429PUK.pdf?v=1704262276\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-P-03 Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
